story.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You need to plan a talk about your historic place and then give the other peson a tour (real or pretend).</p>\n<p>Try to use the passive voice at least three times in your talk - there are some example sentences in the orange box below.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "AT2-5qrcthJ7_J1I5ZoR_", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 452484761, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "CAROUSEL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 452484364, "dimensions": "{\"height\":null,\"width\":null}", "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"scrollingImage": false}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": [{"alt": null, "type": "TEXT", "fileName": null, "fileIdentifier": "-yYxgXWo4_-fASAdLS5mq", "textEditorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">This sofa </span><span style=\"color: rgb(147,101,184);font-size: 18px;\"><strong>was built</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> in 1084 by William the Conqueror.</span></p>\n", "labelEditorState": null}, {"alt": null, "type": "TEXT", "fileName": null, "fileIdentifier": "ha8CtgjZi0t89sxfdHCZF", "textEditorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">This carpet </span><span style=\"color: rgb(147,101,184);font-size: 18px;\"><strong>was saved</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> from Viking invaders in 792 AD.</span></p>\n", "labelEditorState": null}, {"alt": null, "type": "TEXT", "fileName": null, "fileIdentifier": "xc0wlmkJnJE-XhONBAjBy", "textEditorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">In the Kitchen, you can see the Royal Oven, which </span><span style=\"color: rgb(147,101,184);font-size: 18px;\"><strong>was used</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> for baking the King's lasagna.</span></p>\n", "labelEditorState": null}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "ltH6t0nDWasLTtETw5pV0", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 452485777, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 452484364, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><strong>Top tip:</strong></p>\n<p>It would sound weird if you used the passive for every sentence. Try using it to introduce a new object (as in the examples above) and then add more information not in the passive.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "k4Keh-NuVup8ahmnBWsx_", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistIma